      "side": 1,
      "message": "I don\u0027t see a motivation for changing the default value for high water mark to a larger value;  this leads to a larger DRC, and I think most users would prefer a smaller one",
      "revId": "46e002d5ebd99e2ae5174151547853b1fbf7b4c4",
      "serverId": "d5d70762-12d0-45a1-890d-524b12d3f735"
